From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kirill <sleeply4cat@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:06:46 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] board: qualcomm: add CHUWI AuPad environment

Boot /boot/boot.img from the pmos partition, fall back to fastboot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015ya7egg5XM6dMvKwj1kAyq
---
 board/qualcomm/aupad.env | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 board/qualcomm/aupad.env

diff --git a/board/qualcomm/aupad.env b/board/qualcomm/aupad.env
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..391eeec1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/board/qualcomm/aupad.env
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+bootdelay=1
+bootretry=-1
+stdin=serial
+stdout=serial,vidconsole
+stderr=serial,vidconsole
+fastboot=fastboot -l 0x805ff000 usb 0
+pmos=scsi scan && ext4load scsi 0:b 0x805ff000 /boot/boot.img && bootm 0x805ff000
+bootcmd=run pmos; run fastboot
